# External design skills (opt-in stacks)

When implementing UI-facing work under SDD **develop** or **design** phases:

1. Read the active subphase `prompt.json` at `docs/plan/<phase>/<subphase>/prompt.json` (path per workspace conventions).
2. If `designSkillStack.enabled` is **true**, load only the listed skills via `@` path references — never paste full skill bodies.
3. Respect `readFirst`: root `DESIGN.md` and `.nezam/core/gates/design-skills.yaml`.
4. Impeccable CLI (`npx impeccable detect`) complements but does not replace NEZAM design-gates token checks.

If `designSkillStack` is absent or disabled, use NEZAM design skills under `.cursor/skills/design/` per `design-intelligence-index`.

Assembler: `pnpm skills:assemble-design-prompt --phase <hint> --write --dir <subphase-dir>`.
